---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const choices=[{name:'TradingView userscripts',path:'/userscripts/tradingview/'},{name:'Trade Nation userscripts',path:'/userscripts/trade-nation/'}];
const structuredData=[{'@type':'CollectionPage',name:'Browser userscripts by platform',url:new URL(Astro.url.pathname,Astro.site).href,inLanguage:'en-GB',mainEntity:{'@type':'ItemList',itemListElement:choices.map((choice,index)=>({'@type':'ListItem',position:index+1,name:choice.name,url:new URL(choice.path,Astro.site).href}))}}];
---
<Base title="Choose your userscript platform" description="Choose TradingView browser enhancements or Trade Nation trading shortcuts. Trading Statistics has its own guide and current importer details." structuredData={structuredData}>
<section class="section-shell page-intro"><div class="eyebrow">USERSCRIPTS / DESKTOP BROWSER</div><h1>Choose your platform.</h1><p class="lead">Go straight to the scripts for the website you use. Install them in a desktop browser with a userscript manager and follow each tool's setup guide.</p><div class="jump-links"><a href="/install/">Browser installation guide ↗</a></div></section>
<section class="section-shell section-space" aria-label="Userscript platforms"><div class="tool-grid two">
<article class="tool-card" id="tradingview"><div class="card-content"><h2>TradingView</h2><p>AI questions, ticker links, tab titles and watchlist prices for the TradingView website. These do not run in the native TradingView Desktop app.</p><a class="button primary" href="/userscripts/tradingview/">TradingView userscripts ↗</a></div></article>
<article class="tool-card" id="trade-nation"><div class="card-content"><h2>Trade Nation</h2><p>Manual order shortcuts and a position overlay for supported broker chart pages. Check the Hotkeys guide for setup and compatibility.</p><a class="button primary" href="/userscripts/trade-nation/">Trade Nation userscripts ↗</a></div></article>
</div><div class="broker-teaser"><div><div class="eyebrow">INDEPENDENT TOOL</div><h2>Trading Statistics</h2><p>Review your saved trading history. Currently imports Trade Nation CFD and Spread USD accounts. IG support is planned.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="/tools/trading-statistics/">Explore Trading Statistics ↗</a></div></section>
</Base>
